--- !u!114 &114148222050621243
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1413698607491263}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 577
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 恒如真人修炼的是我派秘术《混元引气诀》，战斗时能自如操控一方天地间的{color=#d0380a}引力{/color}，干扰对手以占得上风。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114703857567955712}
  AvatarIntID: 410
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114726185486591259
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1413698607491263}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 576
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 冶庚上人是我派大长老，掌门师尊闭关时的门派事务皆由冶庚长老代为处理。他修炼的《五藏炼尘功》能运用{color=#d0380a}五行相生{/color}之力，最大限度地发挥我派神通威能。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114703857567955712}
  AvatarIntID: 410
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114471671413122892
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1413698607491263}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 561
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 本派外门弟子的法术皆由我来传授，如果你的{color=#d0380a}修为进境{/color}有所提升，就能来我这里学习新的法术。
